# Caddy = free automatic HTTPS (Let's Encrypt, HTTP-01) + reverse proxy.
#
# MVP scope is DEFAULT-BRAND ONLY (ARCHITECTURE.md §3, locked). We serve the
# neutral marketplace on the primary domain with an automatic cert. Set the
# domain by editing the site address below (or templating it in your deploy).
#
# DEFERRED to Release 2 (intentionally NOT enabled — see DevOps review):
#   - Wildcard *.hodorhub.com subdomain certs (need a DNS-01 provider plugin).
#   - Enterprise custom-domain on-demand TLS (needs the /api/tenants/verify-domain
#     allowlist backed by org_branding.domain_verified_at). Enabling on-demand TLS
#     without that endpoint is a cert-issuance DoS vector — do not add it early.

hodorhub.com {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy app:3000
}
